1
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:04,420
要咖啡吗
Want some coffee?

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,660
来一杯吧 这可是法式滤压壶泡出来的
Say yes. It's french press.

3
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,060
一开始我也怀疑
I was doubtful, too,

4
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:10,440
但说实话尝过之后 普通的滤滴咖啡都是浮云
but I honestly can't see myself going back to drip.

5
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,800
真高兴你们终于搬离那个是非之地了
I'm so happy you don't live in a tough neighborhood anymore.

6
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:15,180
这样贸然来访 真是不好意思
We're so sorry for just dropping by like this.

7
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:16,560
你们开什么玩笑
Are you kidding me?

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,560
我巴不得和这位小公主一起呢
I'll take any chance to spend time with this little princess.

9
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,300
软软头发小脚丫 我打心底喜欢
I love her little hair, her little toes.

10
00:00:23,362 --> 00:00:25,374
她也打从心底里喜欢她的奶奶
and she loves her grandmother.

11
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,680
不许叫我"奶奶"
I don't love "Grandmother."

12
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:29,460
我和小卡在修订遗嘱
So, Cam and I have been revising our will

13
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,480
以防天有不测风云
to specify who should take care of Lily

14
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,600
上帝保佑最好没有 我们想给莉莉指定个监护人
if, god forbid, something happened to us.

15
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:34,380
上帝会保佑咱俩的
God forbid.

16
00:00:34,427 --> 00:00:36,613
我刚说了"上帝保佑"
I said "God for--"

17
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,780
所以我们多方突击
So, we've been dropping by unannounced

18
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:41,000
以对所有人选进行评估
to, you know, casually assess our candidates.

19
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,120
也不是"所有"啦
Not all of our candidates.

20
00:00:42,162 --> 00:00:44,278
这倒是 我们没去密苏雷
No, t-that's true. We did not drop by Missour-ah.

21
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:44,820
那念"密苏里"
It's "Missouri."

22
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,373
真没见过自报家门还念错的
No one from Missouri would say "Missour-ah."

23
00:00:46,405 --> 00:00:48,623
多有失"雷"
I'm so sorr-ah.

24
00:00:48,665 --> 00:00:52,078
我们最先考虑的是克莱尔和菲尔
So, anyway, Claire and Phil were our first thought,

25
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:54,000
所以上星期突袭了他们家
so we dropped by their place last week.

26
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:57,180
恭喜您获得"史上最烂老妈奖"
You win the award for worst mother ever!

27
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:59,940
我一定会在获奖感言里感谢你
I will be sure to thank you in my speech!

28
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:01,860
菲尔 煎锅着火了
Phil, the frying pan's on fire!

29
00:01:01,890 --> 00:01:04,938
我滴超人呀 大家保持冷静
Son of Jor-el! Everybody stay calm!

30
00:01:04,978 --> 00:01:07,010
老爸 我想自学杂耍
Dad, I'm gonna teach myself how to juggle.

31
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,040
好极了 伙计
Good for you, buddy.

32
00:01:09,020 --> 00:01:10,880
老妈 你们就听不见我喊救命吗
Mom! No one heard me screaming?!

33
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:13,080
我在车库里被关了大概有20分钟
I've been trapped in the garage for like 20 minutes!

34
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:15,600
而你还是没把我要的捕鼠器拿过来
And yet still you didn't get the rat traps I sent you for.

35
00:01:15,633 --> 00:01:16,427
-老天 -净帮倒忙
- Oh! - Thank you.

36
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:17,960
亲爱的 锅又着火了
Honey, it's doing it again!

37
00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:19,920
不是吧 每天早上都这样
Come on, now! Every morning?!

38
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:21,880
最好烧个片瓦不留
I hope the whole house burns down!

39
00:01:21,905 --> 00:01:23,060
我们是不是来得不巧
Did we come at a bad time?

40
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:25,000
等上七年五个月再来吧
Come back in seven years and five months,

41
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,220
他们走了就清净了
when they're all gone!

42
00:01:38,625 --> 00:01:41,059
煤够吗 妈妈
So, mama, you're good for coal?!

43
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,100
好的 好的
Okay, okay!

44
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:43,020
你可得裹厚穿暖咯
Well, you bundle up!

45
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:44,520
可别有个三长两短的
We don't want to lose you!

46
00:01:45,180 --> 00:01:46,520
好的 再见
Okay. Yeah, bye!

47
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,740
他们正处在一场严重暴风雪正中
They're in the middle of a terrible blizzard.

48
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:49,720
难怪你要大声嚷嚷
So you shouted!

49
00:01:49,752 --> 00:01:51,195
他们真的损失了两头牛吗
Did they really lose two cows?

50
00:01:51,195 --> 00:01:53,724
对啊 冻得硬梆梆 妈妈会把照片寄过来
Oh, yeah, frozen solid. Mama's gonna send pictures.

51
00:01:53,766 --> 00:01:55,768
好耶 又有理由去买相框了
Oh, yay, a reason to stop by the frame store.

52
00:01:55,768 --> 00:01:57,948
曼尼 我带你去趟体育用品店
Manny, I got to get you down to that sporting-goods place.

53
00:01:57,980 --> 00:02:00,200
-为他周末露营置点东西 -整装待发
- Got to get him some stuff for his weekend outing. - Ready!

54
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,320
-尿干净了吗 -待会再发
- Did you pee? Not ready.

55
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:04,420
-不介意我们跟来吧 杰 -怎么会呢
- Jay, would you mind if we came? - Sure, why not?

56
00:02:04,452 --> 00:02:06,108
我想给妈妈买两双雪靴
You know, I'd like to get mama some snowshoes --

57
00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:06,900
雪中送靴 鼓鼓士气
You know, to lift her spirits,

58
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:08,260
舒缓丧牛之痛
what with all the frozen cows and all.

59
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:11,020
所以牛现在就冻住了 你认为我们会相信吗
So, cows freeze now? Are we all just accepting that?

60
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,660
当然了 杰 就次...
Oh, yeah, absolutely. Jay, this one time --

61
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,360
我们分车坐
We'll take two cars.

62
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:16,340
我可以留下来照顾小公主
If you want, I can stay with the little princess.

63
00:02:16,382 --> 00:02:17,868
那可太好了
Oh, that-- that's a great idea.

64
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:19,800
我去拿她的包
Oh, yeah, I'll just -- I'll just go out and get her bag.

65
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,880
我想带她去商场
Maybe I can take her to the mall,

66
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,520
给她添件新衣服
buy her a new outfit,

67
00:02:23,561 --> 00:02:25,890
给她整俩发环什么的 可以吗
get her some hair rings -- is that okay?

68
00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:27,140
当然可以
Yes, yes, of course.

69
00:02:27,195 --> 00:02:30,119
其实呢 歌洛莉亚 我跟小卡一直商量
Um, you know, Gloria, Cam and I were talking

70
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,620
如果我们真出事了
about what would happen to Lily

71
00:02:31,620 --> 00:02:33,140
该怎么安置莉莉
if anything were ever to happen to us,

72
00:02:33,175 --> 00:02:35,685
-我们打算 -真的吗 让我来照顾她
- and we were thinking - Oh, my god. Is it? I take her!

73
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:37,080
这个嘛 你愿意固然好
Okay, well, that's very sweet,

74
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:38,060
但要明白 只有真出事了...
but you realize it would only happen --

75
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:39,040
我迫不及待啊
I can't wait!

76
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,580
可惜机会渺茫呀
Okay, well, hopefully, it's a long shot.

77
00:02:40,610 --> 00:02:42,690
小丫头
Ay, a little girl!

78
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,940
一旦出事可就惨绝人寰啊
There would have to be a very tragic accident.

79
00:02:45,180 --> 00:02:46,340
知道啦 知道啦
I know, I know.

80
00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:48,860
你们不会出事的
Nothing is going to happen.

81
00:02:48,904 --> 00:02:51,347
好吧
Oh.

82
00:02:51,380 --> 00:02:55,340
万一真出了事 我可就太开心啦
But if it did, we would be so happy!

83
00:02:59,258 --> 00:03:01,420
怎么样 伙计 我要开车去上班
So, what do you say, pal? I got to swing by the office.

84
00:03:01,420 --> 00:03:02,060
你一起来吗
You want to come along?

85
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,500
去不了 我们有事要做
Can't. We got some stuff to do.

86
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,440
-什么事啊 -小事而已
- What? - Just errands.

87
00:03:06,580 --> 00:03:08,540
我要带卢克去看儿童心理学家
I'm taking Luke to see a child psychologist.

88
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:11,840
菲尔肯定不会同意
This is something that Phil would never agree to.

89
00:03:11,872 --> 00:03:14,557
他不想卢克觉得自己 异于常人
He's doesn't want luke to feel...different.

90
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:16,360
但是卢克学习不好
But Luke's grades aren't great,

91
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,480
而且他在学校注意力涣散
and he's having trouble concentrating in school.

92
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:21,320
我只想确保他 身心正常
I just want to make sure that he's...normal.

93
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:25,080
-妈妈快看呀 -你干什么呢
- Hey, mom, check it out. - What are you doing?

94
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,580
只要我晃头的速度够快
If I move my head fast enough,

95
00:03:26,660 --> 00:03:28,540
这罐子看起来就像静止了一样
It looks like the can is standing still.

96
00:03:28,576 --> 00:03:32,052
因为有时我怀疑
'cause sometimes I wonder.

97
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:33,360
不过我公司的女孩子
But all the girls at work love it

98
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,240
都喜欢我带卢克过去
when I bring luke by,

99
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:36,180
特别是那个叫海瑟的前台 是吧
especially that receptionist Heather, right, buddy?

100
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,200
她闻起来很香
She smells amazing.

101
00:03:37,261 --> 00:03:38,920
亲爱的 恐怕你得改天再去
Mm. Well, honey, you're gonna have to

102
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,500
一闻你老爸前台的芳香了
smell daddy's receptionist some other time.

103
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,460
那香味像桃子
Like peaches.

104
00:03:41,460 --> 00:03:44,060
你们都出去了 谁带我去练大提琴
If you're both going out, who's taking me to cello?

105
00:03:44,101 --> 00:03:46,099
-有次 她送我一个胡迪 -亲爱的
- One time, she gave me a woody. - Sweet je--

106
00:03:46,140 --> 00:03:48,680
她记得那是《玩具总动员》里我最喜欢的角色
She remembered he's my favorite character from "Toy story."

107
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:49,740
她记性好
She did.

108
00:03:49,770 --> 00:03:52,485
海莉 你怎么去购物中心
Uh...Haley, how are you getting to the mall?

109
00:03:52,515 --> 00:03:54,518
盖比接我过去
Uh, Gabby's picking me up.

110
00:03:54,558 --> 00:03:55,280
好 那你先把你妹妹
Okay, you're gonna drop

111
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,700
送去上大提琴课
your sister off at her cello lesson first.

112
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:59,700
不是吧 她会打长曲棍球还会拉大提琴
No way. She plays lacrosse and takes cello lessons.

113
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:02,160
即使我那强大的坏名声 也承受不住那呆瓜的一击呀
Even my reputation can't handle that dork hit.

114
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:03,200
好吧 那你假期的时候
Okay, well, then you don't need

115
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,080
也不要和你的朋友去滑雪了
to go snowboarding with your friends on break.

116
00:04:05,700 --> 00:04:07,100
好吧 我带她过去
Fine, I'll take her.

117
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,700
别跟我朋友直视
Just never look my friends in the eye,

118
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:09,980
尽量别出声
and only speak in emergencies.

119
00:04:10,012 --> 00:04:12,497
-没问题 -已经犯规了
- Got it. - Ah! Already failed.

120
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,340
亲爱的 我去办公室露个脸
Honey, after I go by the office,

121
00:04:15,380 --> 00:04:17,400
-咱们就去吃午饭吧 -不行
- maybe we can grab some lunch. - Oh, I can't.

122
00:04:17,500 --> 00:04:18,960
我要把学校露营的东西都准备齐了
I got to pick up all that stuff for the school trip.

123
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:20,920
这样吧 今晚在老爸和歌洛莉亚家碰面吧
But you know what? I'll see you tonight at dad and Gloria's.

124
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,800
-好 -代我一闻海瑟的芳香
- Okay. - Smell Heather for me.

125
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,800
我一直都是充鼻 不闻
I always do...not.

126
00:04:29,618 --> 00:04:31,131
邓菲夫人吗
Ms. Dunphy?

127
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,140
克劳斯乐医生您好
Hi, Dr. Klausner.

128
00:04:32,140 --> 00:04:33,460
抱歉我们来晚了
I am so sorry we're late.

129
00:04:33,460 --> 00:04:34,640
刚才路上有点堵车
We just got a little bit caught up in --

130
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,280
没事没事
Oh, no, it's okay. It's okay.

131
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,020
正好给我机会跟你丈夫聊了会
It gave me a chance to chat with your husband.

132
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,200
你好啊 克莱尔
Hello, Claire.

133
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,420
那么卢克 跟我来
So, Luke, come on in with me.

134
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:43,140
至于父母 有需要我们会通知你们的
Mom and dad, we'll let you know when we need you.

135
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:46,879
伙计 加油
Go get 'em, pal.

136
00:04:46,940 --> 00:04:48,500
-你怎么 -我怎么了
- How did you -- - How did I what?

137
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,920
怎么知道你在这儿 除了日程表上的小记号
Know you were someplace you left no trace of

138
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,840
你没有留下一丝线索
except for a tiny notation in your calendar?

139
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,740
真挺容易的
It was quite simple, really.

140
00:04:54,798 --> 00:04:56,928
我注意到日程表上的小
I noticed a tiny nota--

141
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:57,480
糟糕
Shoot.

142
00:05:02,178 --> 00:05:05,224
真奇怪 我大提琴老师的车不在
That's weird. My cello teacher's car isn't here.

143
00:05:05,300 --> 00:05:06,460
我真怀疑她是否在家
I wonder if she's not home.

144
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,680
那就敲门试试啊 艾伦·爱因斯坦
Okay, so go knock on the door, Alan Einstein.

145
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:11,740
- 不许走 还有是"阿尔伯特" -我知道
- Don't leave. And it's "Albert."- I know.

146
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:13,792
艾伦是他那个拉大提琴的呆瓜弟弟
Alan's his dorky brother who played the cello.

147
00:05:13,820 --> 00:05:14,620
说得好
Good one.

148
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:18,840
我本来不应该跟你说的
I should probably not be telling you this.

149
00:05:18,884 --> 00:05:20,887
-什么 -没什么 很糟的事情
- What? - Nothing. It's really bad.

150
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:21,400
快说
Tell me.

151
00:05:21,740 --> 00:05:23,140
你和迪兰分手的时候
When you and Dylan were broken up,

152
00:05:23,167 --> 00:05:24,480
雷切尔跟他说你是个荡妇
Rachel told him you were a skank

153
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,700
然后彻底偷走了他
and got all up on him.

154
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:28,520
不是吧 她对我很好的
No! But she's so nice to me.

155
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,260
当着你的面而已 她就会耍这种小把戏
To your face. That's how she plays.

156
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:32,260
那就让她看看咱们的小把戏
Well, now she's gonna see how we play.

157
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,020
我们要怎么做
What are we gonna do?

158
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:35,340
她不在家 你们把我送回家就行了
She's not there. You're just gonna have to take me home.

159
00:05:35,580 --> 00:05:38,220
我们没时间 忙着呢
We don't have time. We have stuff to do.

160
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:39,860
那我就得一直跟着你了
Then I'm just gonna have to come with you.

161
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:40,780
我们不能把她放在咖啡厅
Can't we just drop her off

162
00:05:40,780 --> 00:05:41,760
或者别的什么地方吗
at a coffee shop or something?

163
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,040
什么啊 那她要是被绑架了
What, so she gets kidnapped

164
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,920
我不等于惹祸上身吗
and I get in trouble?

165
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,800
谢谢 还是算了
No, thank you.

166
00:05:45,340 --> 00:05:46,760
行 你能跟着
Okay, fine, you can come with us,

167
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:49,160
但是不管看到什么 请管好你的嘴
But you have to keep your mouth shut about anything you see.

168
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,800
-她会看到什么 -开车
- What's she gonna see? - Just drive!

169
00:05:52,740 --> 00:05:54,980
或许我应该给我的阿姨派特也买个礼物
Ooh, maybe I should also get a gift for my aunt Pat.

170
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:56,120
我有跟你提起过她吗
Have I ever told you about her?

171
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:58,620
是一个十足的枪械狂 不留痕迹地生活着
Total gun nut, lives completely off the grid.

172
00:05:58,700 --> 00:06:00,500
你看见歌洛莉亚和莉莉在一起多可爱
Did you see how cute Gloria was with Lily?

173
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,600
派特十分滑稽
Oh, Pat is hilarious.

174
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:03,260
我觉得她二十年都没交过税
I don't think she's paid taxes in 20 years,

175
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:04,120
但为人很热情
but very hospitable.

176
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,520
冰箱里总是备着一只鹿
Always has a deer in the freezer.

177
00:06:05,580 --> 00:06:06,380
你有在听我说话吗
Would you listen to me?

178
00:06:06,380 --> 00:06:07,540
我觉得歌洛莉亚和我老爸
I think that Gloria and my dad

179
00:06:07,540 --> 00:06:08,740
可以做莉莉的监护人
could be Lily's guardians.

180
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:10,520
听着 你知道我爱杰
Look, you know I love Jay,

181
00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:11,800
他们家还在名单中
and they're still in the mix,

182
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:14,420
但他养育孩子方面我还不了解
but I just don't know about him raising a child.

183
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:16,180
得了 小卡 他把我养大了
Well, Cam, he raised me.

184
00:06:17,700 --> 00:06:19,820
好吧 你这话就让我陷入了尴尬的局面
Well, now you've put me in an awkward position.

185
00:06:21,260 --> 00:06:23,700
看看 这真可爱
Oh, look at that. That's adorable.

186
00:06:24,140 --> 00:06:25,820
看看能不能帮你找几条滑雪裤
Let's see if we can get you some snow pants.

187
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:27,500
真希望我感觉好点了
I just wish I felt better.

188
00:06:27,536 --> 00:06:29,544
我觉得我有些流感症状
I think I'm coming down with flu-like symptoms.

189
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:31,300
就在去露营的前几小时吗
Couple of hours before your camping trip, huh?

190
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:32,340
我想去啊
I want to go.

191
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,320
只不过 要是我病了
It's just, if I'm sick,

192
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,421
我可能会传给监护人
I might get the chaperones sick,

193
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:36,420
要是没有监护人 就乱套了
And without chaperones, it's anarchy.

194
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,140
曼尼 听我说
Manny, listen to me.

195
00:06:37,140 --> 00:06:38,560
伙伴制会崩溃的
The buddy system falls apart,

196
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:40,920
"后进先出"的规则就会被忽视
The principle of "Last in, first out" is ignored.

197
00:06:40,980 --> 00:06:42,200
-有蝴蝶 -在哪儿
- It's butterflies. - Where?

198
00:06:42,460 --> 00:06:43,860
你不过是紧张了 因为
You're just nervous because

199
00:06:43,860 --> 00:06:45,502
会有很多的体育活动
there's gonna be a lot of physical activity,

200
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:47,220
而且都不是你的长处
which is not exactly your strong suit.

201
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:48,920
那地方有点让人龟缩
It is a little daunting out there.

202
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:51,514
不要对大自然用"龟缩"这个词儿
D-don't use the word "daunting" in nature, okay?

203
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:53,140
你需要一点点自信
You just need a little self-confidence.

204
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,680
看 他们有一堵攀岩墙
Look at this. They got one of these rock walls here.

205
00:06:55,900 --> 00:06:56,960
去试一试吧
Why don't you hop up on that?

206
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,140
为什么
Why?

207
00:06:58,300 --> 00:07:00,000
什么为什么 这可以证明你能行
Why? To prove that you can do it.

208
00:07:00,042 --> 00:07:01,640
你要是能做到这个 你什么都能做到
If you can do that, you can do anything.

209
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:04,860
是吗 我能飞吗 我能讲中文吗
Really? Can I fly? Can I speak Chinese?

210
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,560
不 但你今晚能在我们房里睡觉
No, but you can sleep in the house tonight.

211
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:10,700
埃斯 麻烦给我孩子系上绳子 去吧
Ace? Want to wire my boy up, here? Go ahead.

212
00:07:10,940 --> 00:07:12,500
抱歉我背着你来这儿
I'm sorry I went behind your back.

213
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:14,280
但是我们每次讨论卢克的问题时
But you get so defensive whenever

214
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:15,560
你总是不容分说地反对
we talk about Luke's issues.

215
00:07:15,820 --> 00:07:18,440
他没有问题 是你太过担心了
He doesn't have issues. You're just a worrier.

216
00:07:18,478 --> 00:07:20,172
就像你当初担心他以后不会讲话一样
Like when you thought he was never gonna talk.

217
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,280
他两岁那会儿 只会跟狗一样吠
He was 2, and all he could do was bark!

218
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:23,980
-我了解他 -菲尔
- I understood him. - Phil!

219
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:26,720
听着 他来看医生的事情
Look, he starts coming here,

220
00:07:26,820 --> 00:07:29,120
如果被别的孩子知道 他就成了众矢之的
the other kids find out, he becomes a target,

221
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:31,600
就像跛脚的羚羊在水潭边喝水
like that limping gazelle at the watering hole

222
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,120
被短吻鳄发现了就会来吃它
that the alligator knows to eat.

223
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:34,581
是鳄鱼 不是短吻鳄
They're crocodiles, not alligators.

224
00:07:34,620 --> 00:07:35,700
非洲没有短吻鳄
There are no alligators in Africa.

225
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:36,700
那动物园呢
How about at the zoo?

226
00:07:36,700 --> 00:07:39,039
看吧 到底谁才要看心理医生
Bam! Who needs a shrink now?

227
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,860
-邓菲先生 邓菲太太 -什么事
- Mr. And mrs. Dunphy? - Yes?

228
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:41,260
你好
Hi.

229
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:43,180
卢克 我要跟你爸爸妈妈谈一谈好吗
Luke, I'm gonna talk to your mom and dad for a minute, okay?

230
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,860
好的 她简直是我见过最好的医生
Okay. She's, like, the best doctor ever.

231
00:07:46,260 --> 00:07:48,260
只做了几个题 又不用打针
A couple of puzzles, no shots.

232
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,180
我甚至根本不需要脱裤子
I didn't even have to take my pants off.

233
00:07:50,980 --> 00:07:52,460
早就应该找这种医生了
Found that one out a little late.

234
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:54,200
我以前也遇到过烂医生
I've been there, buddy.

235
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:01,520
卢克这孩子很不错
Well, luke's a terrific kid.

236
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,160
我是发现了一些问题 但是说实话
I have a few thoughts, but, honestly,

237
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,660
我觉得没有什么好紧张的
I don't see anything that's cause for alarm.

238
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,840
那敢情好 耽误您的时间了
Awesome. Thanks so much for your time.

239
00:08:06,929 --> 00:08:08,385
我们很想听听您的意见
We -- we would love to hear your thoughts.

240
00:08:09,180 --> 00:08:12,380
他是个聪明 充满好奇的孩子
Well...he's a bright and curious boy,

241
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:14,540
但是他容易分神
But he gets distracted.

242
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:17,940
我见过很多更容易分神的孩子
I see it all the time with above-average kids.

243
00:08:18,475 --> 00:08:20,160
菲尔 亲爱的 给我认真听
Phil, honey, I want you to hear this.

244
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:23,300
他们会有点过度兴奋
They're a little overstimulated

245
00:08:23,332 --> 00:08:25,848
因为他们对很多事情都充满好奇
because there are so many things they're interested in.

246
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:26,980
他们很难集中精力
They never seem to focus.

247
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,640
就这点让我抓狂
Makes me crazy.

248
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:29,340
抓狂得不得了
Too crazy.

249
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,700
他们长大了就不会这样了
Well, they usually do outgrow it.

250
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:33,878
-要是还这样呢 -他不会的
- What if they don't? - He will.

251
00:08:33,908 --> 00:08:35,660
是有一些药物治疗方案
Well, there's -- there's medication,

252
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:38,600
但是我们得在有问题的时候才使用
but why don't we cross that bridge if we come to it?

253
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:41,220
有没有方法可以防止问题出现呢
Is there any way to avoid that bridge altogether?

254
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,680
或许有食疗
You know, maybe there's diet or --

255
00:08:43,710 --> 00:08:46,194
或者精神集中训练之类的
or focusing exercises or something?

256
00:08:46,234 --> 00:08:47,903
邓菲太太 你到底在担心什么
Mrs. Dunphy, what exactly are you worried about?

257
00:08:47,943 --> 00:08:49,180
庸人自扰
Get comfortable.

258
00:08:49,220 --> 00:08:51,460
我担心他会变成你这样 菲尔
I'm worried he's turning into you, Phil.

259
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:54,520
我知道我在说出这些话的时候
I knew the minute I opened my mouth

260
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:55,340
我已经错了
that I was in the wrong,

261
00:08:55,460 --> 00:08:58,980
但是说实话 有时候我有点搞不懂
but, honestly, sometimes I wonder about him.

262
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,260
-妈 你看我 -你在干嘛
- Hey, mom, check it out. - What are you doing?

263
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:02,760
如果我头摇得够快
If I move my head fast enough,

264
00:09:02,804 --> 00:09:06,316
这罐子看起来就像静止了一样
it looks like the can is standing still.

265
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:07,620
他说得太对了
He's totally right!

266
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:12,300
真有意思 你以前把你从做恶梦
I just find it interesting that you blame Jay

267
00:09:12,300 --> 00:09:14,920
到膀胱害羞症这些事情都归咎于你老爹
for everything from your night terrors to your shy bladder,

268
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:17,260
现在他又成了莉莉最合适的监护人
And now he's the perfect guardian for Lily.

269
00:09:17,260 --> 00:09:18,540
我没说最合适 还有
No, not perfect, and -- and

270
00:09:18,540 --> 00:09:20,480
我从来没提到过我的膀胱害羞症
I never said anything about my shy bladder.

271
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,520
那为什么在派珀的三面元旦派对上
O-oh. Then why did I have to stand guard outside the bathroom

272
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:25,380
我得站在厕所外面放哨呢
at Pepper's three faces of new year's eve party?

273
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:26,940
给点力 曼尼 快爬 快
Damn it, Manny! Move it! Go!

274
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,160
好吓人啊
It's scary.

275
00:09:28,193 --> 00:09:29,895
你才离地两英尺
You're 2 feet off the ground.

276
00:09:29,920 --> 00:09:32,280
藤蔓爬墙都比你快
I've seen vines climb walls faster than that.

277
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,040
赶紧给我爬
Move your butt!

278
00:09:33,084 --> 00:09:36,007
这就是曾经让你树立自信的老爸
Oh, well, there's your esteem-building parent right there.

279
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:38,400
等等 我觉得我听见未来的莉莉
Wait, wait, I think I hear future Lily

280
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:40,440
在脱衣舞钢管上面给我发来信息
sending us a message from her stripper pole --

281
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:41,800
"感谢已故的同性恋爸爸们
"Thanks, gay dead dads.

282
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,080
这舞是给你们跳的"
This dance is for you."

283
00:09:43,280 --> 00:09:44,480
打扰一下 杰
Excuse me, Jay?

284
00:09:44,580 --> 00:09:45,600
我想下来
I'm getting down.

285
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:47,040
等你爬到顶了再说 什么事
Not till you touch the top! What is it?

286
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,960
如果我们不这么强迫曼尼
Well, maybe if we didn't bully Manny so much,

287
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:49,900
而是演示给他看
but, rather, showed him,

288
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:51,200
他可能就不会那么害怕
he wouldn't be so afraid.

289
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:54,240
打扰一下 夏尔巴人 能帮我系上吗
Excuse me, Sherpa, can you assist me with the harness?

290
00:09:55,020 --> 00:09:58,860
天啊 我的驾驶机器在哪里
Oh, no. Which one of these is my driving machine?

291
00:09:59,020 --> 00:10:00,280
菲尔 我已经道歉了
Phil, I already apologized.

292
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,740
那是无意识 脱口而出的
It just -- it came out wrong.

293
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,360
真有趣 我还以为是我的问题呢
Funny, I thought that was my problem --

294
00:10:03,406 --> 00:10:04,852
我出来错了
I came out wrong.

295
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:05,720
等下
Hold on.

296
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:09,360
很好 我又能走路了
Oh, good, I can walk again.

297
00:10:09,820 --> 00:10:11,760
亲爱的 有时候你能表现得稍微
Honey, you know, sometimes you can act a little bit --

298
00:10:11,802 --> 00:10:13,417
天啊 大家都去哪了
Oh, no! Where did everyone go?!

299
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:14,720
一眨眼就不见了
Oh, just a blink.

300
00:10:14,860 --> 00:10:15,200
菲尔
Phil,

301
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:16,960
当你准备好像个成人一样跟我谈的时候
when you are ready to talk to me like an adult,

302
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:18,000
知会我一声好吗
why don't you let me know?

303
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,020
好的 行了 行了
Fine. Okay, okay.

304
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,800
成人是指那些"大"的人 对吧
The adults are the big ones, right?

305
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:37,720
你认为那是怎么挂上去的
Hey, how do you think that got up there?

306
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:43,220
我知道这看起来让人龟缩
Now, I know it seems daunting,

307
00:10:43,560 --> 00:10:45,000
曼尼 但是这其实很简单
Manny, but it's very simple.

308
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,500
我安全地拴在绳子上
I'm securely hitched to a rope,

309
00:10:46,500 --> 00:10:48,600
也就是说我不会掉下来
which means I'm not going to fall.

310
00:10:49,780 --> 00:10:50,620
爸爸 你让我的日子
You know, dad, you're really making

311
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:52,100
-现在变得真不好过 -怎么说
- my life difficult right now.- How?

312
00:10:52,300 --> 00:10:54,440
当我试着说服小卡
By barking at Manny like a drill sergeant

313
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,680
你会是莉莉很好的监护人时
when I'm trying to convince Cam

314
00:10:55,722 --> 00:10:57,308
你却像教官一样地训曼尼
that you'd be a great guardian for lily.

315
00:10:57,340 --> 00:10:58,160
-监护人 -没错
- Guardian? - Yeah.

316
00:10:58,220 --> 00:10:58,880
你开什么玩笑
You're kidding.

317
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,160
杰
Jay!

318
00:11:01,197 --> 00:11:02,431
算了 当我没说过
Yeah, never mind.

319
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,560
这真的很痛
That really hurt!

320
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:08,320
这是一个错误
This is a mistake.

321
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:10,020
为什么她要不停的说这句话
Why does she keep saying that?

322
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,800
因为这是她第一次听到"错误"这个词儿
Because they're the first words she ever heard.

323
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,340
给你 你先来
Here, you go first.

324
00:11:13,580 --> 00:11:15,180
给这个荡妇一个教训
This will teach that Skank a lesson.

325
00:11:16,260 --> 00:11:17,720
往她的置物柜中挤奶油
Shaving cream in her locker?

326
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:19,310
你就站在那儿把风 有人来了就叫
Just stand over there and yell if someone's coming.

327
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,820
她那里可能有还没
She might have homework assignments in there

328
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:22,300
交上去的作业
she hasn't handed in yet.

329
00:11:23,340 --> 00:11:23,780
海莉
Haley!

330
00:11:25,900 --> 00:11:26,940
-有人来了 -快跑
- Someone's coming! - Run!

331
00:11:30,478 --> 00:11:32,897
-这边 这边 -好的 好的 好的
- This way, this way! - Okay, okay, okay!

332
00:11:32,940 --> 00:11:35,140
-我们在哪 -男生置物间
- Where are we? - Boys' locker room.

333
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:36,240
闻起来有股脚臭味
It smells like feet.

334
00:11:36,580 --> 00:11:38,280
这可不是脚臭 好的 来这边
That's not feet. Okay. Come here.

335
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:42,820
我很害怕
I'm so scared.

336
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:44,620
想想那些能令你开心的地方
Just go to your happy place.

337
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:46,040
刚搞破坏的就是能令我开心的地方
We just broke into my happy place.

338
00:11:46,900 --> 00:11:47,560
谁在哪
Who's there?

339
00:11:56,256 --> 00:11:58,592
走 走 跑 跑
Go, go, run, run!

340
00:11:58,603 --> 00:12:01,529
不要这么大声 快跑 快跑
Not so loud! Run! Run!

341
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:02,580
你怎么样了
So, how you doing?

342
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:04,700
不好 我很庆幸我的小丑训练课程
Oh, not good. I'm just glad my clown training

343
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:06,260
让我懂得如何栽跟头
prepared me to take a fall like that.

344
00:12:06,540 --> 00:12:08,300
很好 你以后肯定会对这事喋喋不休
Yeah, and in terms of talking about it,

345
00:12:08,300 --> 00:12:10,600
你是打算说上几周呢 还是几个月呢
Are we looking at weeks, months?

346
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:11,940
不要小看它造成的伤害
Do not minimize it, you,

347
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,660
你上次穿木屐滑到
who I had to rush to the emergency room

348
00:12:13,660 --> 00:12:15,220
居然要我跑到急诊室看你
that time you fell out of your clogs.

349
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:17,260
这是你要的柠檬气泡水
There's your bubbly water with lemon.

350
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,206
谢谢你 杰
Thank you, Jay.

351
00:12:18,429 --> 00:12:19,200
你怎么样了
How you doin'?

352
00:12:19,220 --> 00:12:20,840
很难说
Oh, it's hard to tell.

353
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:22,280
一旦你的腰部
You know, anytime you have

354
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:24,500
出现了重大损伤
a catastrophic injury to your lumbar area --

355
00:12:24,500 --> 00:12:27,140
你要算有腰一族 那我肯定是水蛇腰了
I could use a little piece of lumbar myself right now.

356
00:12:27,166 --> 00:12:29,474
现在让我的家人当莉莉的监护人
Well, I hope you're comfortable now

357
00:12:29,500 --> 00:12:31,500
你不会有异议了吧
making my family Lily's guardians.

358
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:32,940
你好 你好
HOLA, HOLA!

359
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:34,900
你忘了还有歌洛莉亚
You're forgetting about Gloria.

360
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,140
你得承认她和莉莉相处的很不错
Even you have to admit how amazing she is with Lily.

361
00:12:37,177 --> 00:12:40,646
谁家的女儿这么漂亮啊
Mm! Look who's so pretty!

362
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:41,780
天啊
Oh, my god!

363
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:42,680
歌洛莉亚 你做了什么
Gloria, what did you do?

364
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:44,220
我跟你说过了啊
What I told you.

365
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:46,120
你给她穿了耳洞
You pierced her ears?!

366
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:47,200
我说过
What I said --

367
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:49,620
我要用耳环把她点缀得更漂亮
I was going to make her pretty with earrings.

368
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,720
我以为你说的是"发环"
I thought you said "Hair rings."

369
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:53,060
发环是什么
What are hair rings?

370
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:54,700
是的 米奇尔 什么是发环
Yes, Mitchell, what are hair rings?

371
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,480
某种能把头发系在后面
Something that you would tie your hair back --

372
00:12:56,660 --> 00:12:57,720
她是这么说的
she said it!

373
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:59,940
我没有说"发环" 我说的"耳环"
I didn't say "Hair rings." I said "Earrings."

374
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:00,860
你不喜欢吗
You don't like?

375
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,940
当然不 你带我们的女儿去打洞
Of course not. You punctured our daughter!

376
00:13:03,280 --> 00:13:04,880
但你看两边了吗
But did you see both sides?

377
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,840
除了同志专用耳 我另外一只也打了
I didn't just do the gay ear.

378
00:13:07,100 --> 00:13:07,600
瞧
Look.

379
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:08,720
天啊
Oh, my god.

380
00:13:08,761 --> 00:13:10,444
天啊
Oh, my God.

381
00:13:15,337 --> 00:13:19,879
我觉得咱们逃过一劫了
I actually -- I think we're good.

382
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:21,700
我们在这里等盖比 好吗
Let's just wait in here for Gabby, okay?

383
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:24,120
天 我真不敢相信我们刚做了什么
Oh, my god! I can't believe we just did that.

384
00:13:24,460 --> 00:13:25,640
你能相信刚才我们这么做了吗
Can you believe we just did that?

385
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:28,060
是的 我们玩的很开心 用不着大惊小怪
Yeah, we had a lot of fun. Let's not geek it up.

386
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:31,000
等等 如果我爱上这种感觉了怎么办
Wait. What if I have a taste for it now?

387
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,020
我会不会开始一直做这种事情
Am I gonna start doing stuff like that all the time?

388
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:35,320
冷静点 你只不过做了一件坏事
Calm down. You just did one bad thing.

389
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:38,280
两件
Two.

390
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:42,340
我还翘掉了今天的大提琴课
I skipped my cello lesson today.

391
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:45,860
我的老师根本不住那儿
That wasn't even where my teacher lives.

392
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:47,360
你竟然翘课
You ditched a class?

393
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,858
我-我根本没有时间练习
Well, I-I didn't have time to practice

394
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:51,280
因为我有曲棍球和辩论小组还有--
Because of lacrosse and debate team and --

395
00:13:51,660 --> 00:13:52,960
你根本不喜欢弹大提琴吧
Do you even like playing the cello?

396
00:13:53,620 --> 00:13:54,220
我喜欢啊
Yeah.

397
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:55,580
艾丽克斯
Alex?

398
00:13:57,420 --> 00:13:58,560
我讨厌它
I hate it.

399
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:00,840
那就放弃啊
So quit.

400
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,320
我从没放弃过任何东西
I've never quit anything.

401
00:14:02,358 --> 00:14:05,029
你以前还没闯入过学校呢
You've never broke into a school before.

402
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:06,100
你不是刚刚也闯了吗
Just did that.

403
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:09,880
无意冒犯 不过咱们家的希望和梦想
No offense, but the family's hopes and dreams

404
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:10,980
貌似都寄托在我身上
are kind of pinned on me.

405
00:14:12,460 --> 00:14:14,580
我只是说 就算你没有这么完美
I'm just saying that no one would blame you

406
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:16,460
也不会有人责怪你的
if you stopped being so perfect.

407
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:19,580
实际上那样反倒会让我轻松不少
It actually would take a lot of pressure off of me.

408
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:24,500
我也做过一些坏事
I did something bad, too...

409
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:26,780
一些没有人知道的事
Something that nobody knows.

410
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:28,780
-是什么事 -过来
- What? - Come here.

411
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:30,640
我不能太大声说
I can't say it too loud, okay?

412
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,440
你到底做了什么
What did you do?

413
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:41,680
菲尔 我只是不确定你是否明白
Phil, I'm just not sure you understand

414
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:43,700
我会说那些话的原因
why I said what I said.

415
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:46,000
在我身上有很多你希望能够改变的缺点
There are qualities about me you wish you could change,

416
00:14:46,089 --> 00:14:47,593
但你改不了了 因为我已经定型了
but you can't 'cause I'm all grown up,

417
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:48,840
可是对卢克来说还不算太晚
but it's not too late for Luke.

418
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:50,860
好吧
Okay.

419
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:54,380
亲爱的 卢克身上有无数遗传你的优点
Honey, there are a hundred things about luke

420
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:56,820
那些都是我绝对喜爱的
that he gets from you that I absolutely love.

421
00:14:56,855 --> 00:14:59,105
只是 只是有这么小小的一部分
It's just this -- this one tiny part

422
00:14:59,140 --> 00:15:01,900
我坚信如果我能探进去 然后改过来
that I'm sure if I could just get in there and just...ee!

423
00:15:01,949 --> 00:15:04,864
克莱尔 他是个很好的孩子
Claire... he's a great kid.

424
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:05,840
他会没事儿的
He's gonna be fine.

425
00:15:05,900 --> 00:15:06,500
我知道
I know.

426
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:09,220
我想我应该知道吧
I think I know.

427
00:15:10,460 --> 00:15:12,560
咱们俩在他面前吵架 真是糟透了
I feel terrible that we fought in front of him.

428
00:15:13,060 --> 00:15:14,840
他在回来的路上跟你说什么了吗
Did he say anything about that on the drive here?

429
00:15:14,873 --> 00:15:16,869
我怎么知道 他是跟你回来的
How would I know? He rode with you.

430
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:19,200
他没跟我回来 他坐的是你的车
He didn't drive with me. He drove with you.

431
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:23,540
你就承认吧
Just admit it --

432
00:15:23,540 --> 00:15:26,660
除了我的家人 你觉得莉莉被谁养大都行
you want lily raised by anyone but my family.

433
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:28,640
只是因为那种生活和她了解的一切相去甚远
It's just so far away from everything she knows.

434
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:31,400
而且那里有位疯狂的阿姨和两头冻奶牛
And then there's the crazy aunts and the frozen cows.

435
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:32,700
拜托 就在前一小时
Oh, please, in the last hour,

436
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:34,280
你爸让曼尼在大庭广众之下丢了脸
your father publicly shamed Manny,

437
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:35,520
把我从半空摔了下来
dropped me from the sky,

438
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:38,580
他老婆还在我们宝贝的耳朵上打了两个洞
while his wife drilled holes in our baby's head.

439
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:39,960
所以我才认为
Which is why I think

440
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,789
咱们应该再去克莱尔和菲尔那里看看
we should revisit claire and phil.

441
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:42,380
我的钥匙呢
Where are my keys?

442
00:15:42,980 --> 00:15:44,800
我们把卢克一个人留在停车场了
We left Luke alone in a parking garage!

443
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:47,500
我们并不了解整件事
We don't know the whole story.

444
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:48,580
真的吗
Don't we?

445
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,260
-咱们开谁的车去 -我的
- Whose car are we taking? - Mine.

446
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:51,380
那我来开车
Then I'm driving!

447
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:53,900
妈妈
Hey, mom.

448
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:55,740
-儿子 -卢克
- Buddy! - Luke?

449
00:15:55,789 --> 00:15:57,338
-儿子 -小克
- Buddy! - Lukey?

450
00:15:57,338 --> 00:15:59,391
-太谢谢您了 -宝贝儿 快下来
- Thank you so much. - Honey, get out of there.

451
00:15:59,440 --> 00:15:59,940
谢谢
Thank you!

452
00:15:59,940 --> 00:16:01,479
我很抱歉 我们非常抱歉
I'm so sorry. We are so sorry.

453
00:16:01,479 --> 00:16:03,435
-儿子 你肯定吓坏了吧 -没有
- Oh, buddy, you must've been so scared.- No.

454
00:16:03,435 --> 00:16:04,653
-天哪 -是怎么回事儿
- Oh, god. - Well, what happened?

455
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:06,260
我知道你们会回来的
Well, I knew you'd come back.

456
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:07,820
结果你们没来
Then you didn't.

457
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:09,480
所以我只好去找电话
So I had to go find a phone.

458
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:11,420
就是那时候我看见了一只迷路的狗
That's when I saw a stray dog

459
00:16:11,420 --> 00:16:12,700
然后和他玩儿了一会儿
and I played with him for a while.

460
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,840
接着我以为我看见我一年级时的老师
Then I thought I saw mrs. Morgan,

461
00:16:15,020 --> 00:16:17,000
摩根太太 她正要进教堂
my first-grade teacher, going into a church.

462
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,220
结果那不是她
It wasn't her,

463
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,680
但是那时教堂正好在举行婚礼
but there was a wedding there.

464
00:16:19,722 --> 00:16:21,088
我就是在那里遇见利特瓦克一家的
That's where I met the Litvaks.

465
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:23,140
谢谢你们 太感谢了
Oh, thank you! Thank you so much.

466
00:16:23,168 --> 00:16:24,434
恭喜恭喜[Mazel Tov为犹太语的恭喜]
Congratul-- tov.

467
00:16:25,878 --> 00:16:27,238
宝贝儿
Mwah! Oh, baby.

468
00:16:27,266 --> 00:16:28,682
-我能去喝点东西吗 -当然可以
- Can I go get a drink? - Yes, you can.

469
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:30,920
去喝吧 想喝什么就喝什么
Yes, you can! You can drink whatever you want!

470
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,540
家里有一堆汽水呢
There's tons of soda in there.

471
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:37,180
多棒的孩子
What an amazing kid!

472
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:39,980
真不敢相信我会担心他在外边出事
I can't believe I ever worried about him out in the world.

473
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:43,400
但母亲都这样 对吧 我担心
That's what I do, though, isn't it? I worry.

474
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:46,100
我担心他 我只不过想到了一点小事
I worry -- I think about a tiny, little thing,

475
00:16:46,100 --> 00:16:47,460
就一直钻牛角尖 直到刚才突然间
and then I obsess on it, until, suddenly,

476
00:16:47,460 --> 00:16:49,180
我脑子里只想着一件事
it's the only thing I can think about.

477
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:51,240
上帝啊 别让我毁了咱们的儿子
God, please don't let me screw up our son.

478
00:16:55,207 --> 00:16:57,289
你知道他还会因为什么没事吗
You know why else he's gonna be okay?

479
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:57,680
不知道
No.

480
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:01,540
因为这个世界上一定还有个担忧的小女生
Because somewhere out there is a worried little girl

481
00:17:01,540 --> 00:17:04,160
像你一样会列一堆清单 会给垃圾分类
who's making lists and labeling bins,

482
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:09,000
他会找到她的
and he's gonna find her.

483
00:17:15,180 --> 00:17:15,680
小卡
Cam?

484
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:18,960
我知道你对杰成为莉莉的监护人的事有偏见
I know you're kind of down on jay being lily's guardian.

485
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:21,220
你不用管这事 曼尼
Now, that's not anything you need to worry about, Manny.

486
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:23,280
我只是觉得你对他太苛刻了
I just think you're being too hard on him.

487
00:17:23,700 --> 00:17:25,240
我和他在车里小谈了一下
We had a little chat in the car.

488
00:17:25,980 --> 00:17:27,460
很抱歉让你失望了 杰
I'm sorry I let you down, Jay.

489
00:17:27,460 --> 00:17:30,600
我开始觉得如果我连那堵墙都爬不上
I'm starting to think if I couldn't even get up that wall,

490
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:32,360
-我还奢望去什么露营呢 -别这样说 曼尼
- Then why am I even going on this - Knock it off, Manny.

491
00:17:32,420 --> 00:17:34,080
我们心里都清楚你能做到
We both know you could get up that wall.

492
00:17:34,980 --> 00:17:36,940
你为什么不想去这次旅行
Now, why are you trying to get out of this trip?

493
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:38,920
我哪有 我兴奋着呢
I'm not. I'm excited to go --

494
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:39,580
你骗不了我 曼尼
Manny...

495
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:41,420
好吧
Okay.

496
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:44,540
我担心洗澡这事儿
I have some concerns about the shower situation.

497
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:45,460
怎么了
Oh. Because?

498
00:17:45,660 --> 00:17:48,440
-我显然达到了目标体重 -不错啊
- Well, I'm pretty much at my target weight. - That's good.

499
00:17:48,620 --> 00:17:52,600
但是 我没达到我的目标身高
But the thing is, I haven't quite reached my target height.

500
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:55,560
原来如此
Got it.

501
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:57,040
首先 你可以不去
All right, first of all, you don't have to go.

502
00:17:57,520 --> 00:17:58,820
我会帮你写张假条
I'll write you a note.

503
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,920
我们周末去做其他有趣的活动
We'll plan on doing something fun this weekend.

504
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:02,180
-真的吗 -当然
- Really? - You bet.

505
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:03,500
你不生我的气
And you're not mad at me?

506
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:05,860
听着 如果你是其他孩子 我就会教训他
Look, if you were a different kid, I'd give you the speech --

507
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:08,220
害怕是理所当然
You know, "We all have insecurities.

508
00:18:08,340 --> 00:18:09,560
可你必须勇敢面对
You've got to be brave here."

509
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:10,840
可事实是
But let's face it --

510
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:12,700
你是我见过最勇敢的孩子
You're already about the bravest kid I know.

511
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:14,300
-真的吗 -得了吧
- I am? - Come on.

512
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:17,420
你穿鲜艳的运动夹克去学校 你会吹排箫
You wear blazers to school. You play the pan flute.

513
00:18:17,459 --> 00:18:20,341
你会对女生读情诗
You -- you read poetry to girls.

514
00:18:20,380 --> 00:18:22,560
我在你这年纪的时候 都不敢和女生说话
I couldn't even talk to girls when I was your age.

515
00:18:22,590 --> 00:18:25,431
和这些事迹比起来 洗澡就是小巫见大巫
The shower thing's nothing compared to all that.

516
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:29,093
无论你如何决定 我永远支持你
So, whatever you decide, I'm behind you.

517
00:18:31,629 --> 00:18:33,830
别 我都设置好了
No, I got that set up just right.

518
00:18:33,860 --> 00:18:35,930
早告诉过你不许碰
I told you about that before.

519
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:36,740
杰和你这么说的
Jay said that?

520
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:39,240
他可是十分清醒的
Yeah, and he wasn't drinking or anything.

521
00:18:39,285 --> 00:18:40,765
你准备怎么做
So, what are you gonna do?

522
00:18:40,810 --> 00:18:42,735
我觉得我会去的
I think I'm gonna go.

523
